# playpick: mode=raid boss=marrow spec=mage:frost style=idle size=10
# difficulty=normal view=844x390,touch save=fresh
#
# Only one of the fourteen prior mode=raid sessions walked in from the front
# page rather than an invite-hash shortcut -- 2026-09-24-1.play, the very
# first session this job ever ran. Every mode=raid pull since has skipped
# straight to the fight via `open #b=...`, which a real new player never
# types. This repeats the genuine front-door path a second time, on the axis
# playpick actually assigned: a ranged dps caster instead of a tank, and
# landscape touch (844x390) instead of portrait (390x844).
open
targets
shot front
tap raid
shot raid-setup
tap next
shot class-pick
tap class:mage:frost
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
shot arrive-threshold
state
walkto 0 -1000 10
shot in-vigil
state
walkto 0 -6000 45
shot in-spire
state
targets
play idle 240
shot after-idle
state
bill
says
tap outcome:retry
shot after-retry
state
targets
